    "https://marshall.peopleadmin.com/postings/32779": {
      "title": "Marshall University Employment Opportunities | LS EdD - Part-time Graduate Assistant - Fall 2026",
      "description": "Marshall University Employment Opportunities | LS EdD - Part-time Graduate Assistant - Fall 2026 Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Campus ID Office Title IX IT Service Desk Parking Payroll LS EdD - Part-time Graduate Assistant - Fall 2026 Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title LS EdD - Part-time Graduate Assistant - Fall 2026 Description of GA Assignment GA: Faculty Support - Assist faculty, services may include tasks as supervising laboratories under their supervision; grading quizzes, homework, and other projects; and assist with other course and research related duties as assigned. Job Description Summary The Faculty Support GA will work collaboratively with faculty to support teaching, scholarship, and program initiatives within the Leadership Studies program. Responsibilities may include serving as a teaching assistant, developing instructional and program resources, supporting student engagement, assisting with event planning, participating in research-related activities, grade quizzes, homework, and other projects; and assist faculty with other course and research related duties, and completing other duties as assigned. Adhere to Marshall University and the College of Education and Professional Development’s professional expectations, FERPA requirements, confidentiality expectations, and communication practices. Department Educational Doctoral Program - MU2840 Location MUGC - Marshall University South Charleston Semester Fall Semester Hours Per Week Part Time (10 hrs a week) Qualifications Required Qualifications Education Must be a current LSAP Doctoral student Experience Must be a current LSAP Doctoral student Preferred Qualifications Education Experience Posting Detail Information Posting Number MU3174GA Open Date 08/24/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions Summary Supplemental Questions Require