Medical Grand Rounds per year. SOC Code 25-1071 5% allocation of duties. Full-Time position w/ University Physicians & Surgeons Inc. d/b/a Marshall Health. CV to Jarrett Gerlach at jarrett.gerlach@mhnetwork.org EOE . Location MUSOM - Marshall University School of Medicine Salary Range Salary is commensurate with experience and internal equity Qualifications Must be able to perform all essential job duties as outlined in the job description. Required Qualifications Education MD or professional equivalent level degree in Medicine; Experience Completion of 12 months Fellowship in Surgery-Breast Surgery or Breast Surgical Oncology; Board Certified or Board Eligible in General Surgery; West Virginia Medical License eligibility. Preferred Qualifications Education Experience Posting Detail Information Posting Number MU1879F Open Date 07/21/2026 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions Summary Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Do you have a MD or professional equivalent level degree in Medicine? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Marshall University One John Marshall Drive Huntington, WV 25755 Copyright © 2020 Marshall University | An Equal Opportunity University | Accreditation | Consumer Information and Disclosures To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
